    "pageUnit": "major_question",
    "sharedInstructionsHtml": "<section class=\"source-page-card question-shared-instructions\" data-question-shared-instructions><div class=\"page-kicker\">全大問共通</div><h2>2025年度 医学部 一般選抜 数学</h2><p class=\"prose\">（80分）</p><h3>答えに関する注意事項</h3><p class=\"prose\">1．解答は、対応する解答欄にマークせよ。</p><p class=\"prose\">2．<span class=\"answer-slot\">ア</span>、<span class=\"answer-slot\">イウ</span> などには、特に指示がない限り、符号（−、±）または数字（0〜9）が入る。</p><p class=\"prose\">例　<span class=\"answer-slot\">アイ</span> に −3 と答えたいとき。</p><figure class=\"crop-card\" data-crop-id=\"notice-mark-example\" data-replacement-status=\"pending_redraw\"><div class=\"replacement-pending\">図版の模写差し替え待ち<br>原本クロップは公開候補へ含めていません</div><figcaption>解答欄のマーク方法を示す原本例。（差し替え待ち）</figcaption></figure><p class=\"prose\">同じ解答欄が2度以上現れる場合、2度目以降は細字で表記する。</p><p class=\"prose\">3．分数は既約分数で答え、符号は分子につける。</p><p class=\"prose\">4．根号の中の自然数が最小となる形で答える。</p></section>",
    "printNotes": [
      "各設問に記載された解答形式・記号・単位の指定に従ってください。",
      "図版準備中・内容確認中の設問は、確認が完了するまで演習対象外です。"
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "id": "major-question-01",
        "label": "第1問",
        "order": 1,
        "sourcePageIds": [
          "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-questions-p002"
        ],
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>第1問</h2><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"answer-slot\">ア</span>〜<span class=\"answer-slot\">ノ</span> に適する符号または数字をマークせよ。</p><h3>（A）</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a=(\\sqrt5+1)/2,\\ b=(\\sqrt5-1)/2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a=(\\sqrt5+1)/2,\\ b=(\\sqrt5-1)/2</span> のとき</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"a^3+b^3=\\boxed{\\text{ア}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">a^3+b^3=\\boxed{\\text{ア}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}</div><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt a+\\sqrt b}{\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b}=\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{エ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{\\sqrt a+\\sqrt b}{\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b}=\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{エ}}}</div><h3>（B）</h3><p class=\"prose\">756と792の最大公約数は <span class=\"answer-slot\">オカ</span>、4601と5029の最大公約数は <span class=\"answer-slot\">キクケ</span>。</p><h3>（C）</h3><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"\\log_2 2x-2\\log_{1/4}(9-2x)-2^{\\log_2 8}&lt;0\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\log_2 2x-2\\log_{1/4}(9-2x)-2^{\\log_2 8}&lt;0</div><p class=\"prose\">の解は</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"\\boxed{\\text{コ}}&lt;x&lt;\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{サ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{シ}}},\\quad\\boxed{\\text{ス}}&lt;x&lt;\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{セ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ソ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\boxed{\\text{コ}}&lt;x&lt;\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{サ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{シ}}},\\quad\\boxed{\\text{ス}}&lt;x&lt;\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{セ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ソ}}}</div><h3>（D）</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\vec a|=4,|\\vec b|=\\sqrt3,|\\vec a+\\vec b|=5\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\vec a|=4,|\\vec b|=\\sqrt3,|\\vec a+\\vec b|=5</span>。</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=\\boxed{\\text{タ}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=\\boxed{\\text{タ}}</div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\vec a+t\\vec b|\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\vec a+t\\vec b|</span> は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=\\boxed{\\text{チツ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">t=\\boxed{\\text{チツ}}</span> で最小値 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{テト}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{テト}}}</span>。</p><h3>（E）</h3><p class=\"prose\">双曲線 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"C:3x^2-2y^2+24=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">C:3x^2-2y^2+24=0</span> の焦点は</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"(0,\\pm\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ニ}}})\" data-display-mode=\"true\">(0,\\pm\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ニ}}})</div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(2\\sqrt2,2)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(2\\sqrt2,2)</span> における接線は</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"y=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ヌ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ネ}}}x+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ノ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">y=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ヌ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ネ}}}x+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ノ}}}</div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "第2問",
        "order": 2,
        "sourcePageIds": [
          "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-questions-p003"
        ],
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>第2問</h2><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"A(0,3),B(1,0),C(3,0),D(3,1)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">A(0,3),B(1,0),C(3,0),D(3,1)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"K:y=-2x^2-1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">K:y=-2x^2-1</span> とする。</p><h3>（1）</h3><p class=\"prose\">PがK上を動くとき、APの中点の軌跡は</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"y=\\boxed{\\text{アイ}}x^2+\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">y=\\boxed{\\text{アイ}}x^2+\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}</div><h3>（2）</h3><p class=\"prose\">QからKへ引いた2接線の接点をR、S、RSの中点をMとする。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(t,-2t^2-1)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(t,-2t^2-1)</span> における接線は</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"y=\\boxed{\\text{エオ}}tx+\\boxed{\\text{カ}}t^2-\\boxed{\\text{キ}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">y=\\boxed{\\text{エオ}}tx+\\boxed{\\text{カ}}t^2-\\boxed{\\text{キ}}</div><p class=\"prose\">QがBC、AB、AD上を動くときのMの軌跡は順に</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"y=\\boxed{\\text{クケ}}x^2-\\boxed{\\text{コ}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">y=\\boxed{\\text{クケ}}x^2-\\boxed{\\text{コ}}</div><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"y=\\boxed{\\text{サシ}}x^2+\\boxed{\\text{ス}}x-\\boxed{\\text{セ}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">y=\\boxed{\\text{サシ}}x^2+\\boxed{\\text{ス}}x-\\boxed{\\text{セ}}</div><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"y=\\boxed{\\text{ソタ}}x^2+\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}}x-\\boxed{\\text{テ}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">y=\\boxed{\\text{ソタ}}x^2+\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}}x-\\boxed{\\text{テ}}</div><p class=\"prose\">四角形ABCDの周を動くとき、囲まれる面積は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}}</span>。</p></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "第3問",
        "order": 3,
        "sourcePageIds": [
          "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-questions-p004",
          "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-questions-p005"
        ],
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>第3問</h2><p class=\"prose\">一辺1の正六角形ABCDEFがあり、Pは初めAにある。</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"q3-regular-hexagon\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics/figures/q3-regular-hexagon.svg\" alt=\"一辺1の正六角形。AからB、C、D、E、Fが反時計回りに並び、Aの反対側がD。点PはAから出発する。\" width=\"700\" height=\"535\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>第3問：頂点の順序と移動規則。解答の経路は描き込んでいない。</figcaption></figure><p class=\"prose\">サイコロで2以下なら時計回りに2、3以上なら反時計回りに1進む。</p><h3>（1）</h3><p class=\"prose\">2回後にFにある確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ア}}}{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ア}}}{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}</span>。</p><h3>（2）</h3><p class=\"prose\">3回後にAにある確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ウエ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{オカ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ウエ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{オカ}}}</span>。その条件で途中にDを通らない確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{キク}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ケコ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{キク}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ケコ}}}</span>。</p><h3>（3）（i）</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"l,m,n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">l,m,n</span> は正の整数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3l\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3l</span> 回後にDにあり、途中でDを通らない確率は</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"\\left(\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{サ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{シ}}}\\right)^{\\boxed{\\boxed{\\text{ス}}}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\left(\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{サ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{シ}}}\\right)^{\\boxed{\\boxed{\\text{ス}}}}</div><h3><span class=\"answer-slot\">ス</span> の選択肢</h3><p class=\"prose\">① <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"l-1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">l-1</span>　② <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"l\" data-display-mode=\"false\">l</span>　③ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"l+1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">l+1</span>　④ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3l-3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3l-3</span>　⑤ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3l-2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3l-2</span>　⑥ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3l-1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3l-1</span>　⑦ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3l+1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3l+1</span>　⑧ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3l+3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3l+3</span></p><h3>（3）（ii）</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n</span> 回後にAにある確率を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"p_n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">p_n</span> とする。</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"p_{3(m+1)}=-\\frac1{27}p_{3m}+\\frac{14}{27}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">p_{3(m+1)}=-\\frac1{27}p_{3m}+\\frac{14}{27}</div><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"p_{3m}=\\frac12\\left\\{\\left(-\\frac1{27}\\right)^m+1\\right\\}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">p_{3m}=\\frac12\\left\\{\\left(-\\frac1{27}\\right)^m+1\\right\\}</div><h2>第4問</h2></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-04",
        "label": "第4問",
        "order": 4,
        "sourcePageIds": [
          "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-questions-p005",
          "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-questions-p006"
        ],
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-04\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-04\"><h2>第4問</h2><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}|\\sin2t-x\\cos2t|\\,dt\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f(x)=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}|\\sin2t-x\\cos2t|\\,dt</div><h3>（1）</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(0)=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ア}}}{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(0)=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ア}}}{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}</span>。</p><h3>（2）（i）</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\\leqq0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x\\leqq0</span> のとき</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{エ}}}(\\boxed{\\text{オ}}-x)\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f(x)=\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{エ}}}(\\boxed{\\text{オ}}-x)</div><h3>（2）（ii）</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x&gt;0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x&gt;0</span> で <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sin2\\alpha-x\\cos2\\alpha=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sin2\\alpha-x\\cos2\\alpha=0</span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"\\cos2\\alpha=\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{カ}}}{\\sqrt{x^2+\\boxed{\\text{キ}}}},\\quad\\sin2\\alpha=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+\\boxed{\\text{キ}}}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\cos2\\alpha=\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{カ}}}{\\sqrt{x^2+\\boxed{\\text{キ}}}},\\quad\\sin2\\alpha=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+\\boxed{\\text{キ}}}}</div><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\sqrt{x^2+\\boxed{\\text{ク}}}-\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ケ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{コ}}}(x+1)\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f(x)=\\sqrt{x^2+\\boxed{\\text{ク}}}-\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ケ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{コ}}}(x+1)</div><h3>（2）（iii）</h3><p class=\"prose\">全実数上で <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{サ}}}{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{シ}}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{サ}}}{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{シ}}}}</span> のとき、最小値 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{セ}}}-\\boxed{\\text{ス}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ソ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{セ}}}-\\boxed{\\text{ス}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ソ}}}</span>。</p><h3>（3）</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{x^2+1}=u-x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sqrt{x^2+1}=u-x</span> と置換すると</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"\\int_0^{\\sqrt3}f(x)\\,dx=\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{タ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}\\{\\log(\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{テ}}})+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}\\}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\int_0^{\\sqrt3}f(x)\\,dx=\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{タ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}\\{\\log(\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{テ}}})+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}\\}</div></article>"
      }
    ]
